###
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users

###
// Request a un usuario en especifico
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users/10

###
// Request a un usuario que no existe
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users/100

###
// Send request
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sofia Maldonado",
    "username": "ch0fas"
